ounded by Flames he encourages shuri  to embrace the raid within her to take  all the power she can and strike back  against the world that has hurt her so  much apparently as this rage that brings  her to killmonger in the first place  sure you miss that she never really  believed the ancestral plane was real  before and that she only ingested the  her because she wanted enough strength  to kill Neymar the implication is that  the herb can tell a person's intention  and adjust their experience accordingly  shuri certainly misses her mother but  she likely knows what embaku tells her  later is true that remonda wouldn't want  her to go to war even for her own sake  so instead shuri subconsciously he seeks  an ancestor who'd be more supportive of  her bid for Revenge killmonger fits that  Bell quite nicely  when shuri goes into a final battle  against Neymar at the end of wakanda  forever she doesn't do it alone  obviously embaku the Dora milaje and  some other wakandan Warriors join her  mission to kill Neymar but she has three  particularly strong allies thanks to  some new super suits Riri emerges in a  new and improved ironheart suit under  Korea and daneka get their Dora skills  maxed out with some new Midnight Angel  suits of course einhardt is a familiar  character for fans of the comics and the  star of her own MCU series after wakanda  forever but the Midnight's angels are  also pulled from the comics in the  comics are the most elite members of the  Dora melange but they don't get the cool  blue super sou makes for them in the  movie all three of these suits seem to  be hybrids of the old black panther suit  Tony Stark's later Iron Man models and  show his own personal Innovations the  end result is quite impressive at the  talocaniel quickly find out after a  tense action-packed battle shuri has the  opportunity to kill Neymar she wants to  avenge her mother but is bigger than  that she has all her rage at the world  into a hatred of Neymar but when she has  the blade at his neck she just can't go  through with her she realizes all the  ways in which wakanda and talukan are  the same she sees herself in namor's  people and of course she gets a soft  hand on her shoulder from her mother who  appears to tell her not to go through  with her revenge it's not entirely clear  whether this is truly remondo Channel  order through the power of the  heart-shaped herb or if it's simply a  manifestation of shuri's inner turmoil  but at the same time she sees her mother  Neymar sees his it's possible that this  is a truly mystical moment the effects  of vibranium modified genes striking  both characters at once and connecting  them to their deceased parents  regardless a forge a piece out of it  albeit one that maymore makes with other  intentions in mind as he reveals to  namora at the end of the movie he  believes the rest of the world will come  for wakanda eventually when they do  shuri may be desperate enough to agree  to Neymar's plans for all-out war  whether does settled from wakanda's  brief war with talocon Sherry goes on a  little trip to see Nakia in Haiti though  wakandan gathering in celebration of the  New Black Panther gets a record scratch  moments when embaku not shuri descends  from a ship and announces that the  princess won't be joining them he then  announces his desire to make a bid for  the throne something he did  unsuccessfully in the first black  panther before being defeated and later  embraced by t'challa  sin Cuts away before the audience can  see how it will play out leaving things  a bit confusing there was dialogue after  Amanda's death where the elders mention  their need to choose a new leader even  after shuri gains her powers and dons  the Black Panther suit she's referred to  as Princess not queen of course if a  condom Throne is always up for grabs to  those willing to fight for it but sure  he isn't even present when embaku makes  his bed maybe she has no desire to be  queen of wakanda or perhaps she's just  happy being the Black Panther protector  of her people and all around science  wears it's possible that some Baku is  making a power play in her absence but  given his loyalty throughout the film  that seems unlikely MCU fans will have  to wait for Black Panther's MCU return  to see how this whole situation plays  out but for now it's clear sure he is  taking some time alone to process and  heal as her mother encouraged black  panther wakanda forever doesn't have a  traditional MCU post-credits sequence  but there is a scene worth sticking  around for after the first round of  credits roll as she watches her funeral  clothes burn on the beach in Haiti  surely meets an unexpected stranger the  son of her late brother and the Kia who  Bears his father's name how does this  secret child exist presumably he was  conceived surely before the infinity War  snap as Nakia was present in wakanda up  until tachala was taken by Thanos that  would have allowed Nakia to leave for  Haiti before anyone would have noticed  that she was pregnant it also would have  meant that t'challa wouldn't have met  his son until he was four or five after  the late King returned to life in the  blip even after that he and Nakia  decided to keep their child a secret so  that he might grow up having a normal  childhood Nakia tells shuri that  t'challa prepared her and their son for  his death and that remondo got to meet  the boy presumably this is what raimonda  wanted to tell shuri about her brother  on the night they met Neymar after an  entire movie about the effects of grief  meeting the young t'challa is a welcomed  spark of hope he's a reminder that  family never really dies and that the  future can once again be bright  [Music]
 

